  <prompt>
    Ship the eval coverage that gates the five R2 catalog rows (FR-12 / NFR-06). For each of `compose-explain-clause`, `compose-compare-to-playbook`, `compose-draft-alternative`, `compose-summarize-word-changes`, `compose-defined-terms`, author a golden-utterance family AND a dispatch family, ≥5 cases each, extending the EXISTING golden-utterance harness (do NOT build a second harness). Assert correct dispatch through the shipped seam, schema conformance against each Action's OutputSchemaJson, and (where applicable) citation integrity. Confirm every row's OutputSchemaJson passes OpenAiFunctionSchemaValidator with no property-level boolean `required`. A row without this coverage does not merge.
  </prompt>

  <role>
    Test engineer expert in the Spaarke golden-utterance / dispatch eval harness, ADR-038 KEEP-class integration-test conventions, and OpenAiFunctionSchemaValidator catalog contract tests.
  </role>

  <goal>
    Golden + dispatch eval families (≥5 cases each) added to the existing eval suite for all five R2 catalog rows, plus OpenAiFunctionSchemaValidator confirmation for all five OutputSchemaJson mirrors, with CI green. Each family asserts correct closed-catalog dispatch, schema conformance, and citation integrity where applicable. No row is merge-eligible without its coverage.
  </goal>

  <context>
    <background>
      Spec FR-12 + NFR-06 (golden + dispatch ≥5 each, gate to merge) + NFR-09 (schema validation) + design §7.4 (eval obligation). Extends the shipped golden-utterance harness from spaarke-ai-architecture-redesign-r1 — the BA-editable JSON case file plus the CI contract test that validates inventory + schema. Aggregates the five rows authored in tasks 040–044; the last catalog task before deploy (047).
    </background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file purpose="golden-utterance-suite">tests/integration/contract/Eval/golden-utterances.json — the existing BA-editable eval case file; ADD golden + dispatch families for the five rows here (do not build a second harness)</file>
      <file purpose="eval-runner">tests/integration/contract/Eval/GoldenUtteranceEvalSuiteTests.cs — the CI suite that validates the cases; extend coverage, not the harness</file>
      <file purpose="eval-readme">tests/integration/contract/Eval/README.md — the case schema (caseId, family, channel, expected.outcomeClass, assertions.schemaConformance) to follow</file>
      <file purpose="schema-contract-test">tests/integration/contract/ — the OpenAiFunctionSchemaValidator catalog contract test (CatalogInputSchemaContractTests) that must green for all five rows</file>
      <file purpose="row-mirrors">infra/dataverse/inputschemas/ and infra/dataverse/outputschemas/ — the five Action schema mirrors authored in 040–044, validated here</file>
      <file purpose="binding-mirror">infra/dataverse/sprk_playbookconsumer-rows.json — the five Binding rows whose dispatch the dispatch-family cases assert</file>
      <file purpose="validate-skill">.claude/skills/jps-validate/SKILL.md — schema/render validation the eval gate depends on</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="040" status="blocked">compose-explain-clause row to cover.</dependency>
      <dependency task="041" status="blocked">compose-compare-to-playbook row to cover.</dependency>
      <dependency task="042" status="blocked">compose-draft-alternative row to cover.</dependency>
      <dependency task="043" status="blocked">compose-summarize-word-changes row to cover.</dependency>
      <dependency task="044" status="blocked">compose-defined-terms row to cover.</dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-039">Eval assertions enforce the grounded-output contract: closed-catalog dispatch through the shipped seam, one dispatch protocol, cited reads. Cases MUST NOT assert against any second intent-detection mechanism (none exists) or a tool-name gating list.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">TEST-MODIFYING task: eval suite is KEEP-class at tests/integration/contract/Eval/; banned patterns (Mock&lt;HttpMessageHandler&gt;, DI-registration tests, ctor null-check tests) forbidden; code-review + adr-check run unconditionally at Step 9.5.</constraint>
    <constraint source="NFR-06">Every catalog row ships golden + dispatch eval families, ≥5 cases each — the gate to merge. A row without coverage does not merge.</constraint>
    <constraint source="NFR-09">All five Action OutputSchemaJson pass OpenAiFunctionSchemaValidator; property-level boolean `required` BANNED.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <topic>testing/eval-suite, ai/output-schema-validation, dataverse/catalog-governance</topic>
    <files>
      <file>.claude/adr/ADR-039-grounded-execution-closed-catalogs.md</file>
      <file>.claude/adr/ADR-040-session-ledger.md</file>
